   "id": 5094,
   "url": "https://ama-tsushima-aisai.goguynet.jp/2026/06/05/hasupa-shokamatsuri/",
   "date": "2026-06-05",
   "title": "【愛西市】森川町で「HASUパ 初夏まつり」が6月6日・7日に開催！マルシェやステージイベントが実施されます！",
   "html": "<p>愛西市森川町にある「道の駅 ふれあいの里HASUパーク」の東側都市公園エリアにて、2026年6月6日（土）と7日（日）に「HASUパ 初夏まつり」が開催されます。<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2162\" src=\"https://ama-tsushima-aisai.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/384/2025/06/IMG_5036.jpeg\" alt=\"ふれあいの里HASUパークの看板\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" srcset=\"https://ama-tsushima-aisai.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/384/2025/06/IMG_5036.jpeg 1280w, https://ama-tsushima-aisai.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/384/2025/06/IMG_5036-768x576.jpeg 768w, https://ama-tsushima-aisai.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/384/2025/06/IMG_5036-1024x767.jpeg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" />当日は、ヨーヨーすくいやスーパーボールすくい、めだかすくいに加えて、様々な出店が並ぶマルシェが予定されています。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_5092\" style=\"width: 1424px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5092\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5092\" src=\"https://ama-tsushima-aisai.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/384/2026/06/3.png\" alt=\"愛西市森川町の道の駅ふれあいの里HASUパークで開催されるHASUパ初夏まつりのイベント告知チラシ\" width=\"1414\" height=\"2000\" srcset=\"https://ama-tsushima-aisai.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/384/2026/06/3.png 1414w, https://ama-tsushima-aisai.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/384/2026/06/3-768x1086.png 768w, https://ama-tsushima-aisai.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/384/2026/06/3-1086x1536.png 1086w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1414px) 100vw, 1414px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-5092\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">提供：HASUパーク様</p></div>\n<p>さらに、6月6日にはパフォーマンス、6月7日にはステージイベントが企画されており、7日のステージにはライブハウス「GRANT&#8217;S」も登場します。</p>\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DZGyFiYk_yP/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\" style=\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:500px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\">\n<div style=\"padding:16px;\"> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DZGyFiYk_yP/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;\" target=\"_blank\"> </p>\n<div style=\" display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"></div>\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display:block; height:50px; margin:0 auto 12px; width:50px;\"><svg width=\"50px\" height=\"50px\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"https://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><g transform=\"translate(-511.000000, -20.000000)\" fill=\"#000000\"><g><path d=\"M556.869,30.41 C554.814,30.41 553.148,32.076 553.148,34.131 C553.148,36.186 554.814,37.852 556.869,37.852 C558.924,37.852 560.59,36.186 560.59,34.131 C560.59,32.076 558.924,30.41 556.869,30.41 M541,60.657 C535.114,60.657 530.342,55.887 530.342,50 C530.342,44.114 535.114,39.342 541,39.342 C546.887,39.342 551.658,44.114 551.658,50 C551.658,55.887 546.887,60.657 541,60.657 M541,33.886 C532.1,33.886 524.886,41.1 524.886,50 C524.886,58.899 532.1,66.113 541,66.113 C549.9,66.113 557.115,58.899 557.115,50 C557.115,41.1 549.9,33.886 541,33.886 M565.378,62.101 C565.244,65.022 564.756,66.606 564.346,67.663 C563.803,69.06 563.1